# Claycity Medical Centre — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in values.

# Required for the Claycity AI assistant (Groq)
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# Optional model override (default: llama-3.3-70b-versatile)
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# Other options: llama-3.1-8b-instant, mixtral-8x7b-32768, etc.
